===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{intransitive}} To be [[dark]] or [[gloomy]].
#*'''1891''', Mary Noailles Murfree, ''In the "Stranger People's" Country'', Nebraska 2005, p. 189:
#*:Around all the dark forest '''gloomed'''.
# {{intransitive}} to look or feel [[sad]], [[sullen]] or [[despondent]].

